#: includes/settings.php
#| msgid ""
#| "Which Notification List(s) of should be notified about Device Up/Down "
#| "events?"
msgid ""
"Which Type of Notification List(s) should be used for Device Up/Down events?"
msgstr ""
"Vilken typ av aviseringslista ska användas för händelser när enheten går upp"
" eller ned?"

#: includes/settings.php
#| msgid "Enable Notifications"
msgid "Single Email Notification"
msgstr "Enskild e-postavisering"

#: includes/settings.php
#| msgid "Enable Notification Queue"
msgid "Single Email Notification Subject"
msgstr "Ämne för enskild e-postavisering"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid ""
"This is the Email Subject to be used for all Single Email Notification "
"Emails for both Up and Down Devices."
msgstr ""
"Detta är e-postämnet som används för alla enskilda e-postaviseringar, både "
"när enheter går upp och när de går ned."

#: includes/settings.php
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the Email subject that will be displayed in the Email (128 Char "
#| "MAX).  Leave blank for the default.  There are several common replacement "
#| "tags that may be used in include:<br>&#060PHASE&#062 "
#| "&#060THRESHOLDVALUE&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062 "
#| "&#060DSNAME&#062 &#060BREACHUP&#062 &#060REALERT&#062 &#60HOSTNAME&#62"
msgid ""
"This is the Email subject that will be used for Down Device Messages. There "
"are several common replacement tags that may be used in "
"include:<br>&#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060SITE&#062 "
"&#060LOCATION&#062 &#060DOWN/UP&#062 &#060DOWNTIME&#062 (last state up "
"duration in case down message) &#060NOTES&#062"
msgstr ""
"Detta är e-postämnet som används för meddelanden om enheter som är nere. "
"Flera vanliga ersättningstaggar kan inkluderas:<br>&#060HOSTNAME&#062 "
"&#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 &#060DOWN/UP&#062 "
"&#060DOWNTIME&#062 (varaktigheten för föregående uppe-läge när meddelandet "
"gäller nere-läge) &#060NOTES&#062"

#: includes/settings.php
#| msgid ""
#| "This is the message that will be displayed as the message body of all UP / "
#| "Down Device Messages (1024 Char MAX).  HTML is allowed, but will be removed "
#| "for text only Emails.  There are several common replacement tags that may be"
#| " used in include:<br>&#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060HOST_ID&#062 "
#| "&#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 &#060UPTIME&#062 "
#| "&#060UPTIMETEXT&#062 &#060DOWNTIME&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 "
#| "&#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062 &#060MESSAGE&#062 "
#| "&#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060DOWN/UP&#062 &#060SNMP_HOSTNAME&#062 "
#| "&#060SNMP_LOCATION&#062 &#060SNMP_CONTACT&#062 &#060SNMP_SYSTEM&#062 "
#| "&#060LAST_FAIL&#062 &#060AVAILABILITY&#062 &#060TOT_POLL&#062 "
#| "&#060FAIL_POLL&#062 &#060CUR_TIME&#062 &#060AVG_TIME&#062 &#060NOTES&#062"
msgid ""
"This is the message that will be displayed as the message body of all UP / "
"Down Device Messages (1024 Char MAX).  HTML is allowed, but will be removed "
"for text only Emails.  There are several common replacement tags that may be"
" used in include:<br>&#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060HOST_ID&#062 "
"&#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 &#060UPTIME&#062 "
"&#060UPTIMETEXT&#062 &#060DOWNTIME&#062 (last state up duration in case down"
" message) &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 "
"&#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062 &#060MESSAGE&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 "
"&#060DOWN/UP&#062 &#060SNMP_HOSTNAME&#062 &#060SNMP_LOCATION&#062 "
"&#060SNMP_CONTACT&#062 &#060SNMP_SYSTEM&#062 &#060LAST_FAIL&#062 "
"&#060AVAILABILITY&#062 &#060TOT_POLL&#062 &#060FAIL_POLL&#062 "
"&#060CUR_TIME&#062 &#060AVG_TIME&#062 &#060NOTES&#062"
msgstr ""
"Detta är meddelandet som visas som brödtext i alla meddelanden om enheter "
"som går upp eller ned, högst 1024 tecken. HTML är tillåtet men tas bort i "
"e-postmeddelanden med enbart text. Flera vanliga ersättningstaggar kan "
"inkluderas:<br>&#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060HOST_ID&#062 &#060DESCRIPTION&#062 "
"&#060SITE&#062 &#060LOCATION&#062 &#060UPTIME&#062 &#060UPTIMETEXT&#062 "
"&#060DOWNTIME&#062 (senaste tiden i uppe-läge om meddelandet gäller nere-"
"läge) &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 "
"&#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062 &#060MESSAGE&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 "
"&#060DOWN/UP&#062 &#060SNMP_HOSTNAME&#062 &#060SNMP_LOCATION&#062 "
"&#060SNMP_CONTACT&#062 &#060SNMP_SYSTEM&#062 &#060LAST_FAIL&#062 "
"&#060AVAILABILITY&#062 &#060TOT_POLL&#062 &#060FAIL_POLL&#062 "
"&#060CUR_TIME&#062 &#060AVG_TIME&#062 &#060NOTES&#062"

